  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 377\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><text x=\"16\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">A model card in five lines</text><text x=\"16\" y=\"42\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono f-muted\">google/muril-base-cased</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"54\" width=\"328\" height=\"247\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Training data</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"78\" font-size=\"14\">Wikipedia, Common Crawl,</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"14\">PMINDIA, Dakshina</text><line x1=\"26\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"110\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Languages</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"14\">16 Indian + English,</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"149\" font-size=\"14\">also in Roman letters</text><line x1=\"26\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"162\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Licence</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"14\">Apache 2.0</text><line x1=\"26\" y1=\"195\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"195\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Known limits</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"215\" font-size=\"14\">weak on languages</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"234\" font-size=\"14\">outside its 17</text><rect x=\"20\" y=\"249\" width=\"320\" height=\"52\" rx=\"6\" class=\"f-ok-soft\"/><line x1=\"26\" y1=\"247\" x2=\"334\" y2=\"247\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"267\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Paid product?</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"267\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">yes, keep the</text><text x=\"140\" y=\"286\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\">licence notice</text><rect x=\"16\" y=\"319\" width=\"328\" height=\"50\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-bad-soft s-bad\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><text x=\"28\" y=\"340\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\">Another model: licence CC BY-NC</text><text x=\"28\" y=\"359\" font-size=\"13\">NC = non-commercial, so no paid use</text></svg>",
  "title": "Read the model card before you use a model.",
  "caption": "This is MuRIL’s model card, cut down to the five Self-check lines. The Apache 2.0 licence allows paid use if you keep its licence notice. Some models use a non-commercial licence, such as CC BY-NC, which rules out a paid client product. Always read the card on the Hub yourself, because cards and licences can change.",
